# German orthography (Swiss)

All user-facing German copy on this site uses Swiss spelling: **no ß — only ss**.

| Avoid | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Spaß | Spass |
| Fuß | Fuss |
| Straße | Strasse |
| groß | gross |
| heiß | heiss |
| schließen | schliessen |
| fließen | fliessen |
| daß | dass |

Apply this in pages, blog posts, data strings, UI labels, and alt text.
